1 NOTE There have been many documents associated with the marriage which reflects a lot of legalities that had to be covered.
2 CONT ES.41168.SNAHN/1.1.2.3.11//Osuna. C.117,D.6-54
2 CONT Doc 9 was a carta de dote dated Oct 4 1461, Mairena.
2 CONT Doc 10 This document is a little closer to the intended marriage, dated Dec 3, Marchena 1454.
2 CONT Doc 11 The marriage, finally, Dec 12, 1454.
2 CONT Escritura of document 9:
2 CONT Letter of payment of Dote written by Fernando de Mata on behalf of his Senor, Fernando de Aguilar. Original, Mairena 1461, Oct 4.
2 CONT Escritura document 10:
