1 NOTE PBA Primer duque de Alba, Marqués de Coria, Conde de Salvatierra, Sr. de Valdecorneja, Mancera, La horcajada, y Sehelices de los gallegos, entre otras
1 NOTE The Iron Duke. Gov of the Nederlands 1567 to 1573
2 CONT Don  Fernando Alvarez de Toledo y Pimentel, 3rd Duke of Alba : Don Fernando Alvarez de Toledo y Pimentel, tercer duque de Alba) (October 29 1507 –December 11, 1582  was a Spanish General and governor  of the Spanish Netherlands  (
2 CONC 1567-1573), nicknamed "the Iron Duke by Protestants of the Low Countries, because of his harsh rule and cruelty. Tales of atrocities committed during his military operations in Flanders  Became part of Dutch and English folklore, 
2 CONC forming a new and central component of the Black Legend
2 CONT Known simply as "Alba". 3rd Duke of Alba. General and governor of the Spanish Nederlands from 1567 to 1573. Viceroy of Naples in 1556. Expulsed the French from Italy.
2 CONT According to historic sources, persecuted Protestants savagely.  Also known as the "Iron Duke".
2 CONT Was the protagonist that was against Ruy Gomes de Silva.
