1 NOTE {geni:about_me} vi. Vasco (ii) Porcallo de Figueroa (Source: Alberto Ferrer-Vallaint (Bayamo y Puerto Príncipe), Carlos J. Zerquera (Trinidad y A.G.I), y Juan R. Peix (Sancti-Spíritus y La Habana), "Descendencia de Vasco Porcallo 
2 CONC hasta la sexta generación," 1963-1984, p. 89 y 99.).
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Vasco (ii) Porcallo de Figueroa: Dato 1: Regidor y Alcalde ordinario de Puerto Príncipe. (Source: Alberto Ferrer-Vallaint (Bayamo y Puerto Príncipe), Carlos J. Zerquera (Trinidad y A.G.I), y Juan R. Peix (Sancti-Spíritu
2 CONC s y La Habana), "Descendencia de Vasco Porcallo hasta la sexta generación," 1963-1984, p. 89.) Dato 2: Regidor y Alcalde en Bayamo. (Source: Alberto Ferrer-Vallaint (Bayamo y Puerto Príncipe), Carlos J. Zerquera (Trinidad y A.G.I)
2 CONC , y Juan R. Peix (Sancti-Spíritus y La Habana), "Descendencia de Vasco Porcallo hasta la sexta generación," 1963-1984, p. 99.)
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT He was (Regidor y Alcalde) Governor and Mayor of Puerto Principe (Camaguey), Cuba Information from page 59-60 of https://cubangenclub.org/upload/files/Historia_de_Sancti-Spiritus_-_Vol_I-_Rafael_Perez_y_Luna.pdf
2 CONT
2 CONT On January 4, 1629, Vasco Porcallo de Figueroa, from Sancti-Spiritus, Cuba married Antonia Millan. This is not the Conquistador Vasco Porcallo de Figueroa that was born around 1490 and died in 1550. Not his son, Vasco Porcallo de 
2 CONC Figueroa who was born around 1530. This is probably one of his descendants down the line. Information from page 127 of https://cubangenclub.org/upload/files/Historia_de_Sancti-Spiritus_-_Vol_I-_Rafael_Perez_y_Luna.pdf 
