1 NAME Francisco /Juarez de Figueroa/
2 GIVN Francisco
2 _MARNM Juarez de Figueroa
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1550
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1631
2 ADDR
3 CITY Sancti-Spiritus
3 CTRY Cuba
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} He is listed as a regidor in gthe city government of Sancti-Spiritus, Cuba in 1593. Information from page 80 of https://cubangenclub.org/upload/files/Historia_de_Sancti-Spiritus_-_Vol_I-_Rafael_Perez_y_Luna.pdf
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1594 he is listed as one of the two mayors of Sancti-Spiritus, Cuba . The other was Luis Perez de Corcha Information from page 88 of https://cubangenclub.org/upload/files/Historia_de_Sancti-Spiritus_-_Vol_I-_Rafael_Perez_y_Luna
2 CONC .pdf
2 CONT
2 CONT March 1, 1596, in Sancti-Spiritus, Cuba, Francisco Juarez de Figueroa was granted the place (paraje) known as "Yagua", near the brook "Alazanes" for raisin (ganado menor) sheep/goats. Information from page 92-93 of https://cubange
2 CONC nclub.org/upload/files/Historia_de_Sancti-Spiritus_-_Vol_I-_Rafael_Perez_y_Luna.pdf
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1599, Francisco Juarez de Figueroa was scribe in Sancti-Spiritus, Cuba (probably the scribe to the city). In the same year he petitioned for a grant (merced) to a piece of land on a strip of the Rio de Taguasco, between the (ha
2 CONC tos) of Vijabo and Iguara, for raising (ganado menor) sheep/goats. This grant lead to the Corral of Taguasco. Information from page 94 of https://cubangenclub.org/upload/files/Historia_de_Sancti-Spiritus_-_Vol_I-_Rafael_Perez_y_Lu
2 CONC na.pdf
2 CONT
2 CONT NOTE; POSSIBLE FAMILLY; In "History of Sancti-Spiritus", Francisco Juarez de Figueroa and Alonso Juarez de Figueroa are listed as brothers and possibly sons of Vasco Porcallo de Figueroa.. Information from page 108-109 of https://
2 CONC cubangenclub.org/upload/files/Historia_de_Sancti-Spiritus_-_Vol_I-_Rafael_Perez_y_Luna.pdf
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1603, he is listed as a public scribe and scribe to the municipal government of Sancti-Spiritus, Cuba.He was (regidor) of Sancti-Spiritus, Cuba in 1603. Information from page 112 of https://cubangenclub.org/upload/files/Histori
2 CONC a_de_Sancti-Spiritus_-_Vol_I-_Rafael_Perez_y_Luna.pdf 
2 CONT
2 CONT March 6, 1606; Francisco petitioned for a grant of land (merced), for a sabana he had discovered between Jobosi and the Sierra de Iguara. He was given the grant. He was (regidor) of Sancti-Spiritus, Cuba in 1603. Information from 
2 CONC page 115-116 of https://cubangenclub.org/upload/files/Historia_de_Sancti-Spiritus_-_Vol_I-_Rafael_Perez_y_Luna.pdf
2 CONT
2 CONT 1615: Public and council scribe in Sancti-Spiritus, Cuba from page 120 of https://cubangenclub.org/upload/files/Historia_de_Sancti-Spiritus_-_Vol_I-_Rafael_Perez_y_Luna.pdf
2 CONT
2 CONT 1617: Public and council scribe in Sancti-Spiritus, Cuba Information from page 121 of https://cubangenclub.org/upload/files/Historia_de_Sancti-Spiritus_-_Vol_I-_Rafael_Perez_y_Luna.pdf
2 CONT
2 CONT 1618: Public and council scribe in Sancti-Spiritus, Cuba. Information from page 122 of https://cubangenclub.org/upload/files/Historia_de_Sancti-Spiritus_-_Vol_I-_Rafael_Perez_y_Luna.pdf
2 CONT
2 CONT 1629: Public and council scribe in Sancti-Spiritus, Cuba. Information from page 127 of https://cubangenclub.org/upload/files/Historia_de_Sancti-Spiritus_-_Vol_I-_Rafael_Perez_y_Luna.pdf 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1631; It is believed that this is the year of the death of Francisco Juarez de Figueroa. Duinng his lifetime he served in many positions in the administration of Sancti-Spiritus, Cuba. Among those positions are: (Regidor) in 1593;
2 CONC  Mayor in 1594; Attorney General in 1596; and since 1603 he was a public scribe and the scribe to the council (Municipal Secretary) of Sancti-Spiritus, Cuba. He was a public scribe before becoming the council's scribe from 1603-16
2 CONC 31 (29 years). He was conceded a grant of the corral "Yagua" in 1596, and later a grant for the corral "San Marcos". Upon his death, his widow. Ana de Leon, was wealthy.  Information from page 132 of https://cubangenclub.org/uploa
2 CONC d/files/Historia_de_Sancti-Spiritus_-_Vol_I-_Rafael_Perez_y_Luna.pdf 
