1 NAME Garcia /Perez Polanco/ Mayor of La Vega
2 GIVN Garcia
2 NSFX Mayor of La Vega
2 _MARNM Perez Polanco
1 SEX M
1 DEAT
2 ADDR
3 CITY La Vega
