1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Dona '''Felipa Gonçalves de Ávila''' (II) (Melchior, Antão, João Bethencourt, Georges, Regnault, Jean, Jean, Jean, Regnault, Philippe, Jean) (suffix added for clarification) was also known as Filipa Gonçalves de Áv
2 CONC ila. She was also known as Dona Filipa Gonçalves de Ávila. She was born circa 1520 at São Jorge. She married Damião Dias Picanço, son of Bartolomeu Dias Picanço and Margarida Afonso de Lira, at São Jorge.
2 CONT
2 CONT Damião Dias Picanço was born after 1550 at Terceira. Children of Dona Felipa Gonçalves de Ávila (II) and Damião Dias Picanço were:
2 CONT
2 CONT * +  377  i.   Melchior Gonçalves de Ávila (III) was born circa 1570 at Graciosa. He married F. da Silveira, daughter of Guilherme da Silveira, at São Jorge. He married Dona Luzia Pereira (I), daughter of João Garcia Pereira and I
2 CONC sabel Pereira Rocha, at Terceira. He married Dona Isabel Fernandes at Terceira. 
2 CONT
