1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Dona '''Francisca de Ávila Bettencourt''' (I) (Melchior Gonçalves de Ávila, Antão, João Bethencourt, Georges, Regnault, Jean, Jean, Jean, Regnault, Philippe, Jean) (suffix added for clarification)441,7,555,7,555,7 
2 CONC was also known as Francisca d' Ávila (I).640 She was born circa 1530 at São Jorge.441,7 She married João Gomes de Lemos, son of Francisco Lopes Beirão and Maria Jorge Oliveira, at São Jorge.637,28
2 CONT
2 CONT João Gomes de Lemos637,7,7 was born circa 1530 at São Jorge.442,7 Children of Dona Francisca de Ávila Bettencourt (I) and João Gomes de Lemos were as follows:
2 CONT
2 CONT * +  380  i.   Bartolomeu d'Ávila Bettencourt (I) was born circa 1560 at Terceira. He married Margarida de Oliveira at São Jorge.
2 CONT
2 CONT * +  381  ii.   Francisca d'Ávila Bettencourt (II) was born after 1580 at Rosais, São Jorge. She married Nuno Álvares Teixeira, son of Baltasar Dias Teixeira and Mécia Alvares, at Terceira. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ''in: Bethencourts 1200-2000 <http://web.meganet.net/bettenco/bett0012.htm#id20428>''
