2 CONT Isabel Guzman Arias de Luyando, was the daughter of Juan de Lizano Luyando and Maria Carrillo Mundaca, but she did not marry Andres I Duque de Estrada y Estrada, she married his son Andres II Duque de Estrada; this couple are my a
2 CONC ncestors through the Cisneros family. 
2 CONT A sister of Andres II Duque de Estrada, Leonor granted a Power of Attorney dated 1583, where she demands to be given the right to be interred in the Ecclesiastical burial seat in Santo Domingo, claiming that her parents and grandp
2 CONC arents were buried there.
