0 @N6000000001199716555@ NOTE Juana de la Torre y Roxas was born in Madrid, Spain, and married Alonso Rodriguez de Albor, also born in Madrid, the son of Alonso Rodriguez and María Arbol [sic]. Juana and Alonso emigrated to Cuba with their children, Luis and M
1 CONC aría, and with Juana's then unmarried sister, María de la Torre y Roxas, on March 7, 1568. José Julio de Herrera Vilató wrote that they settled in Puerto Príncipe in 1567.
