0 @N6000000005598851112@ NOTE In 1540, Capitan General was commander of a territory and later became a Governor.  His second in command was Lope de Samaniego and he was also the first to die in the expedition.  Included in his expedition were three women.  Fra
1 CONC ncisca Hozes was wife of the shoemaker.  Maria Maldonado was the expedition nuse and the natural wife of Lope Caballero.
